  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: Targets .NET Standard 2.1 and .NET 8 through 11 on Windows; .NET Framework and .NET Core 1.x/2.x are not supported. Migration: ActiveX VT_I1 now returns SByte; replacing XML target types clears cached serializers; applications must explicitly configure BinaryFormatter and reference its compatibility package on .NET 9+. Fixed message buffer corruption, direct ActiveX Write/Send, partial stream reads, pinned buffer leaks, formatter state, and connection cache cleanup. Added external API XML documentation and compatibility notes. See README for migration details.",
